# Instagram Session Authentication
# To bypass Instagram's login wall, copy your 'sessionid' cookie value from your browser:
# 1. Log in to instagram.com in Chrome/Safari/Firefox
# 2. Open DevTools (F12) -> Application / Storage -> Cookies -> https://www.instagram.com
# 3. Copy the value of the 'sessionid' cookie and paste it below:
# 4. Copy this file to .env: cp .env.example .env
INSTAGRAM_SESSION_ID=
